Core Concept

The simulator integrates biological state vectors ((q_{bio}, p_{bio})) and astrophysical flux fields into a combined Hamiltonian:

[ H(q,p,t) = H_{bio}(q_{bio}, p_{bio}) + H_{astro}(q_{astro}, p_{astro}, t) ]

Chaotic divergence is monitored using Lyapunov exponents:

[ \lambda = \frac{1}{t} \ln \frac{|\delta x(t)|}{|\delta x(0)|} ]

Positive divergence indicates chaos, which is harvested as non‑deterministic entropy for cryptographic key generation.

